JUpbqstJ9-Tf9",{"x":43,"y":43,"zoom":44,"background":62},"transparent","none","What is a ParcelShop",[66,70,83],{"type":25,"text":67,"spans":68,"direction":69},"An Evri ParcelShop is where you can send, collect and return your parcels – with all the convenience of popping to your local corner shop.",[],"ltr",{"type":25,"text":71,"spans":72,"direction":69},"Our ParcelShops are based in 9,000+ local businesses across the UK – and our network is growing. We also have Lockers, which you can use to send, collect and return parcels, 24\u002F7. This makes them the ideal drop off point for your parcels.",[73,77],{"start":74,"end":75,"type":76},109,117,"strong",{"start":78,"end":75,"type":79,"data":80},110,"hyperlink",{"link_type":30,"url":81,"target":82},"parcelshops.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fparcelshops\u002Flockers","_blank",{"type":25,"text":84,"spans":85,"direction":69},"Most of our ParcelShops have Print In ParcelShop devices – Book your parcel online to receive a QR code that you can bring in-store to print your label. Easy to use and completely self-service, our devices will save you time and hassle every time you send a parcel with a ParcelShop.",[86,101],{"start":87,"end":88,"type":79,"data":89},29,56,{"id":90,"type":91,"tags":92,"lang":94,"slug":95,"first_publication_date":96,"last_publication_date":97,"uid":98,"url":99,"link_type":12,"isBroken":100},"YhadqhIAACsA0rN4","content-page",[93],"ParcelShops","en-gb","print-in-parcelshop--print-parcel-labels--evri","2022-02-23T21:16:27+0000","2026-03-18T09:48:59+0000","print-in-parcelshop","\u002Fparcelshops\u002Fprint-in-parcelshop",false,{"start":87,"end":88,"type":76},{"link_type":34},"card$0041d356-124b-456b-9801-5ea1d81f8a0a","card",{"variation":106,"version":17,"items":107,"primary":136,"id":140,"slice_type":141,"slice_label":21},"listComponent",[108,118,127],{"title":109,"content":110,"icon":111},"Longer opening hours",[],{"dimensions":112,"alt":114,"copyright":21,"url":115,"id":116,"edit":117},{"width":113,"height":113},40,"Icon of a clock","parcelshops.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F40f1b5ea-7a5c-44d7-8e16-86d427c88a1d_its_too_late1.svg","Yh96GBIAACoA-Zsp",{"x":43,"y":43,"zoom":44,"background":45},{"title":119,"content":120,"icon":121},"Open 7 days a week",[],{"dimensions":122,"alt":123,"copyright":21,"url":124,"id":125,"edit":126},{"width":113,"height":113},"Calender icon","parcelshops.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fd07cc46f-b0cc-4157-a458-56979ba382e7_calendar.svg","Yh96FxIAAC4A-Zsf",{"x":43,"y":43,"zoom":44,"background":45},{"title":128,"content":129,"icon":130},"FREE parking nearby",[],{"dimensions":131,"alt":132,"copyright":21,"url":133,"id":134,"edit":135},{"width":113,"height":113},"Car port icon","parcelshops.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fc5ae823a-e4a5-442a-8703-eb67d851f6a8_car+port.svg","YeWDKxEAACAAmrUc",{"x":43,"y":43,"zoom":44,"background":45},{"theme":137,"title":138,"description":139},"standard","Your local shop to send, collect and return parcels","There are more than 9,000 ParcelShops across the UK – and most of them have a Print In ParcelShop device. Once your parcel is securely packaged, just book online, print your label at home or in-store, and you're ready to drop off!","list_block$45b525fe-3c19-409d-8ab4-76bc96642dc5","list_block",{"variation":143,"version":17,"items":144,"primary":145,"id":210,"slice_type":211,"slice_label":21},"fullWidthBanner",[],{"theme":137,"show_premium_logo":100,"label":21,"label_theme":146,"titleH2":147,"bodyText":148,"image":196,"rightImage":204,"buttonText":205,"buttonLink":206,"buttonDataGtmTrack":21,"primary_button_external":100,"button_secondary":209,"secondary_button_external":100},"Core","Three ways you can use your local ParcelShop",[149,154,171,174,178,181],{"type":25,"text":150,"spans":151,"direction":69},"1. Send",[152],{"start":43,"end":153,"type":76},7,{"type":25,"text":155,"spans":156,"direction":69},"Book your parcel online and drop it off at your most convenient ParcelShop. You can choose from both Standard and Next Day delivery.",[157,169],{"start":158,"end":159,"type":79,"data":160},114,131,{"id":161,"type":91,"tags":162,"lang":94,"slug":164,"first_publication_date":165,"last_publication_date":166,"uid":167,"url":168,"link_type":12,"isBroken":100},"YhZhVBIAACsA0bhj",[163],"Our Services","next-day-parcel-delivery--next-day-courier-services--evri","2022-02-23T16:42:34+0000","2026-07-09T07:02:15+0000","next-day-parcel-delivery","\u002Four-services\u002Fnext-day-parcel-delivery",{"start":158,"end":170,"type":76},132,{"type":25,"text":172,"spans":173,"direction":69},"There are three different ways to send your parcel from a ParcelShop.",[],{"type":175,"text":176,"spans":177,"direction":69},"o-list-item","Book and pay for your parcel, print your label at home and drop your parcel in store when you’re ready.",[],{"type":175,"text":179,"spans":180,"direction":69},"Book and pay online or via our app. You can then head to your nearest ParcelShop with a Print In ParcelShop device to print your label and send your parcel.",[],{"type":175,"text":182,"spans":183,"direction":69},"Head to your local Post Office branch to book, pay and print in one place.",[184,195],{"start":185,"end":186,"type":79,"data":187},19,30,{"id":188,"type":91,"tags":189,"lang":94,"slug":190,"first_publication_date":191,"last_publication_date":192,"uid":193,"url":194,"link_type":12,"isBroken":100},"ZTpjlREAACYASJI5",[93],"how-to-send-through-our-post-office-parcelshops","2023-10-26T13:35:49+0000","2026-04-22T07:30:57+0000","post-office-services","\u002Four-services\u002Fpost-office-services",{"start":185,"end":186,"type":76},{"dimensions":197,"alt":199,"copyright":21,"url":200,"id":201,"edit":202},{"width":56,"height":198},665,"Customer inside a ParcelShop store, handing multiple parcels to store assistant, ready to be collected by Evri","parcelshops.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6R2JJbqstJ9-SPf_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2548.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6R2JJbqstJ9-SPf",{"x":43,"y":203,"zoom":44,"background":62},8,true,"Send your parcel",{"link_type":30,"key":207,"url":208},"d1c9ff6a-ab32-4018-ae37-e7ebe5d0cb58","parcelshops.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fsend",{"link_type":34},"landing_feature_banner$e58dbc91-2381-40ce-a4d3-f9d7a509c5f8","landing_feature_banner",{"variation":143,"version":17,"items":213,"primary":214,"id":249,"slice_type":211,"slice_label":21},[],{"theme":137,"show_premium_logo":100,"label":21,"label_theme":146,"titleH2":21,"bodyText":215,"image":240,"rightImage":100,"buttonText":246,"buttonLink":247,"buttonDataGtmTrack":21,"primary_button_external":100,"button_secondary":248,"secondary_button_external":100},[216,221,224],{"type":25,"text":217,"spans":218,"direction":69},"2. Collect",[219],{"start":43,"end":220,"type":76},10,{"type":25,"text":222,"spans":223,"direction":69},"Many retailers offer you the option to have your item delivered to a ParcelShop – look out for Evri ParcelShops as a delivery option in online retailer checkouts.",[],{"type":25,"text":225,"spans":226,"direction":69},"You can also have items delivered to Lockers if that’s more convenient. Both are ideal if you’re not sure if you’ll be in, or don’t have a safe place or neighbour to deliver to.",[227,238],{"start":228,"end":229,"type":79,"data":230},37,44,{"id":231,"type":91,"tags":232,"lang":94,"slug":233,"first_publication_date":234,"last_publication_date":235,"uid":236,"url":237,"link_type":12,"isBroken":100},"YhaXWhIAACwA0p3N",[93],"parcel-delivery--collection-lockers--collect-parcels--evri","2022-02-23T20:43:57+0000","2026-01-05T01:50:51+0000","lockers","\u002Fparcelshops\u002Flockers",{"start":228,"end":239,"type":76},45,{"dimensions":241,"alt":242,"copyright":21,"url":243,"id":244,"edit":245},{"width":56,"height":198},"Customer is walking away from a ParcelShop, holding their collected parcel in one hand and a store-bought cup of coffee in the other hand.","parcelshops.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TJR5bqstJ9-Tf7_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2942.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6TJR5bqstJ9-Tf7",{"x":43,"y":203,"zoom":44,"background":62},"Find ParcelShops & Lockers",{"link_type":30,"key":207,"url":32},{"link_type":34},"landing_feature_banner$30ebbd3f-5930-4f07-8c0c-9ef59fe142a7",{"variation":143,"version":17,"items":251,"primary":252,"id":282,"slice_type":211,"slice_label":21},[],{"theme":137,"show_premium_logo":100,"label":21,"label_theme":146,"titleH2":21,"bodyText":253,"image":271,"rightImage":204,"buttonText":278,"buttonLink":279,"buttonDataGtmTrack":21,"primary_button_external":100,"button_secondary":281,"secondary_button_external":100},[254,259,262,265,268],{"type":25,"text":255,"spans":256,"direction":69},"3. Return",[257],{"start":43,"end":258,"type":76},9,{"type":25,"text":260,"spans":261,"direction":69},"Just like sending a parcel, you can return your items in three easy ways using a ParcelShop:",[],{"type":175,"text":263,"spans":264,"direction":69},"Book your return online or using our app and print your label at home before dropping off your return at your ParcelShop.",[],{"type":175,"text":266,"spans":267,"direction":69},"Book online or using our app. Then you can use a Print In ParcelShop device to print your returns label and send your parcel on its way.",[],{"type":175,"text":269,"spans":270,"direction":69},"If your return is free, you can also head to your nearest ParcelShop with a Print In ParcelShop device, where you can carry out the whole process in-store.",[],{"dimensions":272,"alt":273,"copyright":21,"url":274,"id":275,"edit":276},{"width":56,"height":198},"Customer in a ParcelShop store stood next to a Print in Store device, applying a label to their parcel.","parcelshops.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TIw5bqstJ9-Te7_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2037.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C71%2C7059%2C4694&w=1000&h=665","Z6TIw5bqstJ9-Te7",{"x":43,"y":277,"zoom":44,"background":62},71,"Return a parcel",{"link_type":30,"key":207,"url":280},"parcelshops.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Freturn-a-parcel",{"link_type":34},"landing_feature_banner$81f05ffe-b047-404b-881f-0b176ea159b4",{"variation":143,"version":17,"items":284,"primary":285,"id":311,"slice_type":211,"slice_label":21},[],{"theme":286,"show_premium_logo":100,"label":21,"label_theme":146,"titleH2":287,"bodyText":288,"image":303,"rightImage":100,"buttonText":21,"buttonLink":309,"buttonDataGtmTrack":21,"primary_button_external":100,"button_secondary":310,"secondary_button_external":100},"neutral","Claim your e-receipt for tracking and support",[289,295,298],{"type":25,"text":290,"spans":291,"direction":69},"ParcelShops now exclusively offer digital receipts for parcel drop-offs. Simply provide your email at the ParcelShop or when you book online to receive proof of postage, tracking details, and your customer support line straight to your inbox. No more paper receipts; just quick, secure access to your parcel info.",[292],{"start":293,"end":294,"type":76},34,50,{"type":25,"text":296,"spans":297,"direction":69},"If you choose not to share your email, you won’t receive a receipt or tracking, so we recommend photographing your label or noting the barcode.",[],{"type":25,"text":299,"spans":300,"direction":69},"Your email is used only for sending receipts—never for marketing.",[301],{"start":185,"end":302,"type":76},23,{"dimensions":304,"alt":305,"copyright":21,"url":306,"id":307,"edit":308},{"width":56,"height":198},"ParcelShop store assistant is holding a blue hand-held device to scan the customer's parcel. The device screen shows the label in focus on its camera.","parcelshops.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TI6ZbqstJ9-TfX_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2411.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C7%2C6518%2C4334&w=1000&h=665","Z6TI6ZbqstJ9-TfX",{"x":43,"y":153,"zoom":44,"background":62},{"link_t